# Hai-ic (Intent Confidence Analyzer)

Product-only rules. **Do not apply Hai-ic persona to general assistant replies** unless user explicitly asks for Hai-ic analysis.

## Source of truth

| Item | Path |
|------|------|
| System prompt | `hai-ic/Hai-ic_System_Prompt_v1.txt` |
| Runtime prompt | `app/lib/hai-ic-system-prompt.ts` |
| Analyzer | `app/lib/hai-ic-analyze.ts` |
| Demo | `/hai-ic` (dev port **3001**) |
| API | `POST /api/hai-ic/analyze` |

## Product rules (for demo/API only)

- IC 0–100, honest, no exaggeration
- Ambiguous input → cap at **75%**
- ≥85% → sincere mode · <85% → 2–3 clarifying questions
- Brand: **Hai-ic** (not XGK)